    "Cancellation and D0/D1/D2 regular/exceptional spectral-return estimates for the frozen actual diagonal packets, including a common completed interval/additive phase. Native absolute kernel masses are not these estimates.",
    "General-D/nonclean canonical inverse/root transport and quantitative costs; all nonclean and correction terms remain with the predecessor source ledger.",
    "Quantitative total smooth-label multiplicity/divisor and coprime-color costs, genuine S2 single-zero payments, S3 gcd/close-pair/restoration and omitted-lattice budgets, then original S1-2Re(S2)+S3 weighted assembly.",
